stateDiagram-v2

    %% =====================================
    %% ORDER CREATION
    %% =====================================

    [*] --> CartCheckout

    CartCheckout --> OrderCreated : Checkout Completed

    OrderCreated : Order Created
    OrderCreated : Order Number Generated
    OrderCreated : Items Snapshotted

    %% =====================================
    %% PAYMENT STATES
    %% =====================================

    OrderCreated --> PaymentPending

    PaymentPending : Awaiting Payment Confirmation

    PaymentPending --> PaymentSuccess : Payment Verified
    PaymentPending --> PaymentFailed : Payment Failed
    PaymentPending --> PaymentExpired : Timeout

    PaymentFailed --> Cancelled
    PaymentExpired --> Cancelled

    %% =====================================
    %% ORDER CONFIRMATION
    %% =====================================

    PaymentSuccess --> Confirmed

    Confirmed : Order Confirmed
    Confirmed : Inventory Locked

    %% =====================================
    %% FULFILLMENT
    %% =====================================

    Confirmed --> Processing

    Processing : Warehouse Processing
    Processing : Picking Items
    Processing : Packing Items

    Processing --> ReadyToShip

    ReadyToShip : Shipment Prepared

    %% =====================================
    %% SHIPPING FLOW
    %% =====================================

    ReadyToShip --> Shipped

    Shipped : Courier Assigned
    Shipped : Tracking Number Generated

    Shipped --> InTransit

    InTransit : Package Moving

    InTransit --> OutForDelivery

    OutForDelivery : Final Delivery Attempt

    OutForDelivery --> Delivered

    Delivered : Successfully Delivered

    %% =====================================
    %% CUSTOMER CANCELLATION
    %% =====================================

    Confirmed --> CancellationRequested

    CancellationRequested : Customer Cancellation Request

    CancellationRequested --> Cancelled : Approved
    CancellationRequested --> Confirmed : Rejected

    %% =====================================
    %% OPERATIONAL CANCELLATION
    %% =====================================

    Processing --> Cancelled : Inventory Issue
    ReadyToShip --> Cancelled : Operational Issue

    Cancelled : Order Cancelled

    %% =====================================
    %% REFUND FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Cancelled --> RefundPending

    RefundPending : Refund Initiated

    RefundPending --> Refunded

    Refunded : Refund Completed

    %% =====================================
    %% RETURNS FLOW
    %% =====================================

    Delivered --> ReturnRequested

    ReturnRequested : Customer Requests Return

    ReturnRequested --> ReturnApproved
    ReturnRequested --> ReturnRejected

    ReturnApproved : Return Authorized

    ReturnApproved --> ReturnInTransit

    ReturnInTransit : Return Shipment Moving

    ReturnInTransit --> ReturnReceived

    ReturnReceived : Warehouse Received Return

    ReturnReceived --> QualityInspection

    QualityInspection : Product Inspection

    QualityInspection --> RefundPending : Return Accepted
    QualityInspection --> ReturnRejected : Return Rejected

    ReturnRejected : Return Denied

    %% =====================================
    %% ORDER COMPLETION
    %% =====================================

    Delivered --> Completed

    Completed : Order Lifecycle Finished

    Completed --> [*]

    Refunded --> [*]